    <string name="cloud_consent_summary">SGH Voice must send data to the external AI services you select to provide speech recognition, text processing, and translation.</string>
    <string name="cloud_consent_audio">• Recorded audio is sent to the selected OpenAI or Groq speech-recognition API.</string>
    <string name="cloud_consent_transcript">• Transcribed text is sent to the selected Anthropic, OpenAI, or Groq model.</string>
    <string name="cloud_consent_dictionary">• Built-in terms, terms you add, and the selected scene prompt are sent with the speech-recognition request to improve recognition.</string>
    <string name="cloud_consent_provider_terms">Data may be linked to your provider account and is handled under each provider’s retention, deletion, and pricing terms. It is not sent to Shingihou servers. Do not enter information that identifies a patient.</string>
